  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Diplomacy &#x2013; Expert Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will establish an independent secretariat and expert support function to enhance functionality of the Diplomatic Contact Group and drive effective diplomatic action for humanitarian access by providing critical technical and operational capacity to:
- help identify access barriers and provide recommendations for Diplomatic Contact Group members to exert diplomatic efforts in the pursuit of enhanced humanitarian access and protection to conflict affected populations; 
- analyse and help to mitigate security risks to aid workers, building on United Nations Security Council Resolution 2730
- create a mechanism that enables other Diplomatic Contact Group members to contribute financial assistance to the project to support its sustainability in the longer-term;
- provide an independent secretariat to ensure the effective functioning of the Diplomatic Contact Group.</narrative>
  </description>
